## Reviewer Guidelines

### Be Helpful, Not Mean:
❌ "This is terrible, do it right."  
✅ "Consider using a factory pattern here for better testability."

### Use Specific Feedback:
❌ "This function is messy."  
✅ "This nested if-statement chain (lines 23-56) could be simplified using Strategy pattern."

### Check for Consistency:
- Code style matches project conventions
- Naming conventions are consistent
- Error handling follows existing patterns
- Tests match the test structure used elsewhere

---

## Auto-Approval Criteria

Automatically approve PRs if:
```
✅ All security checks pass
✅ No lint errors (warnings OK)
✅ Tests passing
✅ Test coverage ≥ 80%
✅ No critical logical issues
✅ Code comments are accurate
```

### Manual Review Required If:
- New authentication/payment code
- Database schema changes
- API contract changes
- Significant refactoring
- Performance-critical code

