## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

### ❌ Don't:
- Review code line-by-line (review changes, not every line)
- Auto-approve PRs without checking
- Fix issues you don't fully understand
- Be vague or unhelpful

### ✅ Do:
- Review in logical chunks (related features)
- Use CI for automated checks (run before merge)
- Ask clarifying questions for complex logic
- Reference similar code in the codebase
- Link to documentation when suggesting changes

